WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.800
- We saw your boyfriend, Jonathan.

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.633
- [Zooey] Yes, yeah.

00:00:02.633 --> 00:00:03.466
- [Kelly] Jonathan Scott
at the "Property Brothers."

00:00:03.466 --> 00:00:04.300
He was just here.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.540
- He had the best time.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:06.373
- [Kelly] Of course he did.

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.240
'cause he was on the winners team.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.490
- [Zooey] Yeah, you guys won.
- [Kelly] We won.

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:09.450
- We did.
- [Zooey] Yeah.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:10.283
- I don't know that we should

00:00:10.283 --> 00:00:11.685
play games together
again though (chuckles).

00:00:11.685 --> 00:00:12.518
(audience laughs)

00:00:12.518 --> 00:00:13.470
- Oh, cause you guys were like...

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:14.524
- We're very intense.

00:00:14.524 --> 00:00:18.230
- You were like the winners
that brag on everyone.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:19.130
- We were the winners

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:21.460
that definitely let everyone know we won.

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:22.293
(audience laughs)

00:00:22.293 --> 00:00:23.670
- [Zooey] Yeah.
(Kelly chuckles)

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:24.980
- [Zooey] Yeah.
(palms clap)

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:26.900
- Do y'all get like that?
Do y'all play games?

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.680
- We play games. We play a lot of games.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.490
We love doing like escape games

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:31.510
and stuff like that, which...

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:32.730
- Me too.
- Oh, okay.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.330
- Love escape games.
- Let's...

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:35.500
If you want to do an escape room.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.590
- [Kelly] Yes. I already
kind of invited myself.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:38.423
- Oh, yeah.

00:00:38.423 --> 00:00:39.256
(Kelly laughs)
(audience laughs)

00:00:39.256 --> 00:00:40.089
- That's why I didn't win.

00:00:40.089 --> 00:00:40.922
- [Zooey] Whose ex-wife did it best. Yeah.

00:00:40.922 --> 00:00:41.755
- Escape rooms are so fun.
- Oh, so fun.

00:00:41.755 --> 00:00:42.740
- What is it like though? Dating a twin?

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:43.573
I've always wondered.

00:00:43.573 --> 00:00:45.103
Do they mess with you?

00:00:45.103 --> 00:00:48.010
- No. To me they don't look alike at all.

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:49.610
And their personalities are so different.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.560
So like, to me, they just don't look like.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.290
- [Kelly] Wow. Okay, love is interesting.

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:54.472
Because they do look alike.

00:00:54.472 --> 00:00:56.101
(everyone laughs)

00:00:56.101 --> 00:00:57.530
- You know what's so funny?

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:58.653
- Love does shine differently.

00:00:58.653 --> 00:01:01.960
- Even before we, like before...

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.013
We met on "Carpool Karaoke".

00:01:04.013 --> 00:01:05.940
- (giggling) I love that
that's where you met.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.220
- And I was with my sister.

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:09.770
And my sister's like, "I
cannot tell them apart".

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:11.640
Like before we met them and I
was like, "what do you mean?

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:12.890
They look so different to me."

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:13.723
- [Kelly] Oh.

00:01:13.723 --> 00:01:15.630
- So, even before I met them,

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.230
I thought they look totally different.

00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:18.396
- [Kelly] Okay.
- So...

00:01:18.396 --> 00:01:19.790
- Other than like, one
doesn't have the beard.

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:20.623
But, yeah.

00:01:20.623 --> 00:01:21.456
- Yeah.
- [Kelly] No, totally.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:22.380
- But, even without the beard.

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:23.930
- Like they, yeah.
- [Kelly] Yeah, no.

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:24.763
- They don't look alike. To me.

00:01:24.763 --> 00:01:26.861
- You might be alone on
another island right now.

00:01:26.861 --> 00:01:27.694
(everyone laughs)

00:01:27.694 --> 00:01:28.527
- (laughing) See? Am I ever right?

00:01:28.527 --> 00:01:30.500
- I always am on some island.
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.857
It just depends on which one. You know.

00:01:31.857 --> 00:01:33.957
- [Kelly] Those are the most fun people...

